  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New: Live model discovery in 'yp setup' — fetches the model list from each provider's /models endpoint, so newly released models show up without an app update.\nNew: Models cache at ~/.yitpush/models-cache.json with a 24h TTL for instant menu opens between runs.\nNew: (live)/(defaults) indicator in the model selection menu.\nNew: CLAUDE.md guidance file for Claude Code with build/run/pack commands and architecture notes.\nImproved: Model menu paginates at 15 entries to handle providers like OpenRouter (100+ models).\nImproved: Falls back silently to the curated static list on network/auth failure — existing behavior preserved.\nFull changelog: https://github.com/elvisbrevi/yitpush/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
